WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:02.302 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers
and this is "Late Night."

00:00:02.302 --> 00:00:03.303 line:92%
How's everybody doing tonight?

00:00:03.303 --> 00:00:05.839 align:start size:94% position:6%
Okay.
Let's get to the news.

00:00:05.839 --> 00:00:08.375 size:84% position:42%
President Biden visited
a 70-year-old bridge

00:00:08.375 --> 00:00:10.944 align:start size:94% position:6%
in Lake Charles, Louisiana
today while pitching

00:00:10.944 --> 00:00:12.712 line:92%
his jobs and infrastructure plan

00:00:12.712 --> 00:00:14.848 align:start size:94% position:6%
because if Biden's
proof of anything,

00:00:14.848 --> 00:00:17.150 align:start size:94% position:6%
it's how much good
a few thousand dollars

00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:19.019 line:92%
in bridge work can do for you.

00:00:19.019 --> 00:00:20.754 align:start size:94% position:6%
President Biden
went to a Mexican restaurant

00:00:20.754 --> 00:00:23.123 align:start size:94% position:6%
in Washington yesterday
in honor of Cinco de Mayo.

00:00:23.123 --> 00:00:26.893
He had the enchiladas
and Major had the mariachi band.

00:00:26.893 --> 00:00:27.427 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:27.427 --> 00:00:30.163 align:start size:94% position:6%
Senate minority leader
Mitch McConnell said yesterday

00:00:30.163 --> 00:00:32.065 size:84% position:42% line:92%
that, "100% of my focus

00:00:32.065 --> 00:00:33.767 align:start size:94% position:6%
is on stopping
the Biden administration."

00:00:33.767 --> 00:00:36.836 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh, really? I don't remember
seeing you there.

00:00:36.836 --> 00:00:38.505 align:start size:94% position:6%
Put your money
where your mouth is, bud.

00:00:38.505 --> 00:00:40.840 line:92%
Also, where is your mouth?

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:43.476 size:84% position:42%
Allies of Rudy Giuliani
have reportedly asked

00:00:43.476 --> 00:00:45.278 align:start size:94% position:6%
former President Trump
to pay Giuliani

00:00:45.278 --> 00:00:47.981 align:start size:94% position:6%
for representing him
through the 2020 election.

00:00:47.981 --> 00:00:50.683 align:start size:94% position:6%
Um, do they know
what kind of job he did?

00:00:50.683 --> 00:00:53.186 size:84% position:42%
That's like the captain
of the Titanic asking,

00:00:53.186 --> 00:00:56.423 align:start size:94% position:6%
"So, where do I
submit my invoice?"

00:00:56.423 --> 00:00:58.992 align:start size:94% position:6%
A woman was recently arreste
at the Atlanta airport

00:00:58.992 --> 00:01:01.961 align:start size:94% position:6%
after officials discovered
3 pounds of cocaine

00:01:01.961 --> 00:01:03.997 align:start size:94% position:6%
hidden in the bottom
of seven pairs of shoes.

00:01:03.997 --> 00:01:06.833
In her defense, 3 pounds
of cocaine is the only way

00:01:06.833 --> 00:01:09.235 align:start size:94% position:6%
to make your connection
at that airport.

00:01:09.235 --> 00:01:12.372 align:start size:94% position:6%
The fitness company Peloto
recalled two of its treadmills

00:01:12.372 --> 00:01:14.207 align:start size:94% position:6%
yesterday after dozens
of injuries

00:01:14.207 --> 00:01:15.575 align:start size:94% position:6%
involving children
were reported.

00:01:15.575 --> 00:01:20.380 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's crazy. Who can afford
a Peloton and children?

00:01:20.380 --> 00:01:22.348 align:start size:94% position:6%
A woman in Missouri
recently discovered

00:01:22.348 --> 00:01:24.717
a World War II-era Japanese bomb
while gardening,

00:01:24.717 --> 00:01:28.321
which came as a surprise because
she planted cruise missiles.

00:01:28.321 --> 00:01:29.122 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:29.122 --> 00:01:31.391 align:start size:94% position:6%
Employees of a coronavirus
testing facility

00:01:31.391 --> 00:01:33.693 size:88% position:44%
at an Indonesian airport
were arrested yesterday

00:01:33.693 --> 00:01:35.862 align:start size:94% position:6%
for allegedly washing
and re-using

00:01:35.862 --> 00:01:37.497 line:92%
nasal swabs for passengers

00:01:37.497 --> 00:01:40.300 align:start size:94% position:6%
Well, at least
they know who's got COVID now.

00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:43.436 align:start size:94% position:6%
Looks like, uh, yeah...
everyone.

00:01:43.436 --> 00:01:45.338 align:start size:94% position:6%
And finally, Mother's Day
is this weekend,

00:01:45.338 --> 00:01:48.108 align:start size:94% position:6%
according to six voicemail
from your mother.

00:01:48.108 --> 00:01:51.177 align:start size:94% position:6%
And that, you guys,
was the monologue.

